mutation reply puts invalid job identity
detects TypeOK
- /\ replies' = Append(replies, i)
+ /\ replies' = Append(replies, Requests + 1)

mutation accept old generation
detects NoStaleApply
- applies == hasReply /\ capturedGen[id] = g /\ k # None /\ ~p
+ applies == hasReply /\ k # None /\ ~p

mutation accept replies while disabled or paused
detects NoInactiveApply
- applies == hasReply /\ capturedGen[id] = g /\ k # None /\ ~p
+ applies == hasReply /\ capturedGen[id] <= g

mutation start another worker while busy
detects SingleWorker
only requests=2
- starts == launch /\ ~b /\ k # None /\ ~p /\ issued < Requests
+ starts == launch /\ k # None /\ ~p /\ issued < Requests

mutation draining an old or error reply leaves busy set
detects BusyClears
- b == IF hasReply THEN FALSE ELSE busy
+ b == busy
